{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:16.173524+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"OK, I was actually able to work around this issue by `jit`-ing the call to `eig` and specifying CPU. There don't seem to be any downsides here, so I will close this issue.\r\n\r\n```\r\ndef _eig_host(matrix: jnp.ndarray) -> Tuple[jnp.ndarray, jnp.ndarray]:\r\n    \"\"\"Wraps numpy.linalg.eig so that it can be jit-ed on a machine with GPUs.\"\"\"\r\n    eigenvalues_shape = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(matrix.shape[:-1], complex)\r\n    eigenvectors_shape = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(matrix.shape, complex)\r\n    return host_callback.call(\r\n        # We force this computation to be performed on the cpu by jit-ing and\r\n        # explicitly specifying the device.\r\n        jax.jit(jnp.linalg.eig, device=jax.devices(\"cpu\")[0]),\r\n        matrix,\r\n        result_shape=[eigenvalues_shape, eigenvectors_shape],\r\n    )\r\n```","created_at":"2022-10-31T16:18:53Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046#issuecomment-1297339388","id":1297339388,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5NU9P8","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1297339388/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-10-31T16:18:53Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1297339388","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30735893?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mfschubert","id":30735893,"login":"mfschubert","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM1ODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"the callback gives you CPU-bound numpy objects, so I think the ideal thing here would be to callback into `np.linalg.eig`.","created_at":"2022-11-01T11:20:47Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046#issuecomment-1298376343","id":1298376343,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5NY6aX","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1298376343/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-11-01T11:20:47Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1298376343","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2407108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipVinc","id":2407108,"login":"PhilipVinc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDcxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Yes, this is what I originally intended, but for my version of jax and numpy, the jax implementation was much faster. So, I wanted to find a way to use the jax implementation.","created_at":"2022-11-01T15:37:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046#issuecomment-1298719829","id":1298719829,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5NaORV","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1298719829/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-11-01T15:37:52Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1298719829","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30735893?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mfschubert","id":30735893,"login":"mfschubert","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM1ODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Update:\r\n`jax.numpy.linalg.eig` is now supported on GPUs with JAX version [0.4.36](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/releases/tag/jax-v0.4.36). See [#24663](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/24663) for more details.","created_at":"2024-12-10T12:37:40Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046#issuecomment-2531524089","id":2531524089,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6W4_35","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2531524089/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-12-10T12:37:40Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2531524089","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153962326?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/selamw1","id":153962326,"login":"selamw1","node_id":"U_kgDOCS1HVg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/selamw1","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1142926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sharadmv","id":1142926,"login":"sharadmv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDI5MjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1142926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sharadmv","id":1142926,"login":"sharadmv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDI5MjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\nI am trying to run a computation including `jax.numpy.linalg.eig` on a GPU.\r\n\r\nSince `eig` is not implemented with GPU backend, I am trying to use the experimental `host_callback` module to force the calculation to take place on the CPU. Unfortunately, it seems like an attempt is still made to run this on the GPU, which fails.\r\n\r\nThis code snippet reproduces the error, for example in colab with a GPU runtime.\r\n\r\n```\r\ndef _eig_host(matrix: jnp.ndarray) -> Tuple[jnp.ndarray, jnp.ndarray]:\r\n    \"\"\"Performs an `eig` solve on the host (CPU).\"\"\"\r\n    eigenvalues_shape = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(matrix.shape[:-1], complex)\r\n    eigenvectors_shape = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(matrix.shape, complex)\r\n    return hcb.call(\r\n        jnp.linalg.eig,\r\n        matrix.astype(complex),\r\n        result_shape=(eigenvalues_shape, eigenvectors_shape),\r\n    )\r\n\r\nx = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), (3, 3))\r\n_eig_host(x)  # This fails, because `eig` is not implemented for GPU.\r\n```\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\n0.3.23\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\ncolab GPU\n\n### Additional system info\n\ncolab\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n_No response_","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":4,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046/comments","created_at":"2022-10-29T19:27:54Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046","id":1428419639,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"76b900","default":false,"description":"Issues specific to NVIDIA GPUs","id":4243242282,"name":"NVIDIA GPU","node_id":"LA_kwDOCTkjjc786r0q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/NVIDIA%20GPU"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc5VI_Q3","number":13046,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046/timeline","title":"Host callback attempts to perform computation on GPU","type":null,"updated_at":"2024-12-10T12:37:42Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30735893?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mfschubert","id":30735893,"login":"mfschubert","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM1ODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert","user_view_type":"public"}},"pages":{"comments":[{"page":1,"records":4,"sha256":"01ff7f55f37d96a60f84b357b6c0721e04d78a0176ee17ec57631a0e9c9ad17d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13046/comments?per_page=100&page=1"}],"issue":[{"etag":"\"e095adb872480a6b0